    <string name="home_settings">Switch desktop</string>
    <string name="home_settings_help">Switch between your original home and CleanYourTV. Select your original home to stop using CleanYourTV as Home, or CleanYourTV to switch back. The original launcher must be enabled and your TV must provide a home picker; use the restore script first if it was disabled. This row only appears while a second desktop exists to switch to.</string>
